{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123923","id":4664784498,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFgr2cg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123923","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123923.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123923.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123923","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123923/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123923/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123923/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5a91c00148d934e1ce4589e89c23e28651524f8b","number":123923,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Make `EditorPropertyColor` handle tree update edge case that caused color picker to close abruptly","user":{"login":"NitramiuZ","id":67265963,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjY1OTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67265963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ","html_url":"https://github.com/NitramiuZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123912\r\nYou can now edit the color without the color picker closing. It also updates the texture live as it should.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis could be seen as a hacky fix, but it's by far the least hacky fix I could think of. Other ideas involved\r\n- Removing `notify_property_list_changed` from `ImageTexture`'s `set_image` and `update` methods, but this would break if people have added custom inspector plugins. This also doesn't cover the similar issue that ArrayMesh has in the same configuration.\r\n- Trying to use the regular `emit_changed` call instead of the \"preview\" direct set that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/88690 introduced (that was also the cause of the issue this closes). However, problem with using `emit_changed` is that it gets commited to the undo log, which we don't want. So in this case we would need to run `emit_changed` without triggering undo, which I tried but found difficult/even hackier.\r\n\r\nThis is my first PR and is done as part of a CS course where we were asked to contribute to an open source project. I've thought about getting to know the Godot codebase for a long time so this was the perfect opportunity for me!\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"m